---@description "게임에서 사용하는 고정 스탯의 표시 이름과 변화 방향을 정의합니다."
@Logic
script StatDefinitionModel extends Logic

	property any Definitions = {}

	method void OnBeginPlay()
		self.Definitions = {
			vocal = { LocalizationKey = "stat.vocal", SpriteName = "vocal", IsDecreaseBeneficial = false },
			dance = { LocalizationKey = "stat.dance", SpriteName = "dance", IsDecreaseBeneficial = false },
			visual = { LocalizationKey = "stat.visual", SpriteName = "visual", IsDecreaseBeneficial = false },
			fandom = { LocalizationKey = "stat.fandom", SpriteName = "fandom", IsDecreaseBeneficial = false },
			fatigue = { LocalizationKey = "stat.fatigue", SpriteName = "fatigue", IsDecreaseBeneficial = true }
		}
	end

	-- Public API

	@ExecSpace("ClientOnly")
	method string GetLocalizedName(string statKey)
		return _LocaleTextUtil:GetText(self.Definitions[statKey].LocalizationKey)
	end

	method string GetSpriteName(string statKey)
		return self.Definitions[statKey].SpriteName
	end

	method boolean IsDecreaseBeneficial(string statKey)
		return self.Definitions[statKey].IsDecreaseBeneficial == true
	end

end
